A clean run: `Mounting slot` arrives live (~206 s after capture started, well past
rauc's 173-203 s write window), `capture stopped` prints before any `session ended`
(ServerAlive 2/3 correctly never fires on a healthy connection), and `[stats]` lines
land roughly once a second throughout, MemFree/Dirty/Writeback/load/mmc all moving --
busy but not starved. No stray dmesg -w / journalctl -f / stats-loop processes on the
host or board afterward, and the pipeline lock was free.
